{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>He answered</b> — this psalmist speaks in the voice of the pious in exile — in a far-off land, when the time of salvation arrives and they die on the way before reaching Jerusalem. For it is known that the hardship of the road shortens a person's days."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 102, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:52.335944954Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}